# Files every PR appends to merge as a union of both sides, so two branches
# adding at the same spot rebase without a conflict (issue #736).
#
# test-inventory.txt is generated and sorted: a union keeps every line, and the
# gate's `just inventory-update` puts them back in canonical order.
# The rulings file is append-only prose.
#
# docs/contract.md is deliberately NOT here: only §10.8 is appended to; the
# other sections are edited in place, and a union merge of an edited line keeps
# both versions. Its §10.8 stays a conflict a human resolves.
test-inventory.txt merge=union
docs/decisions/2026-10-unattended-rulings.md merge=union
